1
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:04,560
-半夜 -不
- Night. - No.

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,620
-电话时分 我去接 -快接
- Middle of the phone. I got it. - Get it.

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,370
-我手臂睡麻了 我手臂睡麻了 -快接电话
- Oh! My arm's asleep! My arm's asleep! - Get the phone.

4
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:09,990
菲尔 接电话
Phil, get the phone.

5
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:12,020
那是我 你好
That's me. Hello! Hi.

6
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,280
是的 我是克莱尔
Yes, this is she.

7
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:14,320
是谁打来的
Who is it?

8
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,993
是吗 我的天
Okay. Oh, God.

9
00:00:15,993 --> 00:00:17,320
快告诉我发生什么事了
Tell me what's happening here!

10
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,420
海莉被逮捕了
Haley has been arrested.

11
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,160
什么
What?

12
00:00:19,972 --> 00:00:23,580
电话 电话 肯定是我妈
Phone! Phone. I bet that's mama.

13
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:24,900
我刚梦到天上下小鸡
I was just dreaming it was raining chickens!

14
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,600
米奇尔 接电话
Mitchell, answer the phone!

15
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,820
我不正接着嘛 不正接着嘛
Look what I am doing. Look what I am doing, huh?

16
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,180
-喂 -米奇尔
- Hello? - Hey, Mitchell.

17
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:32,680
抱歉吵醒你们 但海莉被逮捕了
I'm sorry to wake you up, but Haley got arrested.

18
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:35,440
天啊 海莉被逮捕了
Oh, God. Haley got arrested.

19
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,400
难怪我梦到小鸡了[女孩]
That explains the chickens.

20
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,840
没错 的确"很灵验"
It does. It adds up.

21
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,680
她为啥被抓了
What's she get arrested for?

22
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:42,020
她是因为在派对喝酒被抓的
Oh, she got caught drinking at some party.

23
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,520
你能和我们一起开车去学校吗
Look, could you drive up to the college with us?

24
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,300
-我们大概需要一个律师 -当然没问题
- I think we're gonna need a lawyer. - Yes, of course.

25
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:48,620
小卡和莉莉可以去你家陪着艾丽克斯和卢克
And Cam and Lily can come over and stay with Alex and Luke.

26
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:49,780
我誓将用生命守护他们
I'll guard them with my life.

27
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,340
我不愿意麻烦他
I hate to bother him.

28
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,520
不 别这么说 他很乐意帮忙
No, no, don't be silly. He's happy to do it.

29
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:54,840
好吧 我们一会儿就过来
Okay, we'll be over in a little bit.

30
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,000
行 我懂了
Oh, I get it.

31
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,940
当你告诉克莱尔我会去她家照看孩子时
When you told Claire I would come over and watch the kids,

32
00:00:58,940 --> 00:00:59,800
她语气很抵触
She was resistant

33
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:02,040
因为她不信任我带孩子的能力
because she doesn't trust my parenting skills.

34
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,180
不 别说傻话了 她只是不愿意麻烦你
No. Don't be silly. She just didn't want to put you out.

35
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:05,480
她女儿都进局子里了
She's got a daughter behind bars

36
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:07,360
还敢指责我不会教育孩子
and she's got the nerve to say I'm a bad parent?

37
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:09,900
-你都不为我辩解 -因为她什么都没说
- You didn't defend me. - Because she didn't say anything.

38
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:10,960
你这么护着她干什么
Why are you protecting her?

39
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:12,380
怎么就没人护着我呢
Why is no one protecting me?

40
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,120
这套不行
No.

41
00:01:16,556 --> 00:01:18,862
接电话 接电话
Ay! Answer! Answer!

42
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:23,560
你最好是有什么好事要说
This better be good.

43
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,100
海莉因为喝酒被逮捕了
Haley got arrested for drinking.

44
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:27,160
我们要去把她保释出来
We gotta go bail her out.

45
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:29,180
你和州北的法官还有联系吗
Do you still have a connection to that judge upstate?

46
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:30,740
-他已经死了 -谁死了
- He died. - Ay! Who died?

47
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:31,480
我的一个老友
An old friend of mine.

48
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:33,060
真令人遗憾 杰
Ay, Jay, I'm so sorry.

49
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:34,560
他五年前就死了
He died five years ago.

50
00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:36,840
那他们大半夜把我们吵起来
Then why are they calling us in the middle of the night

51
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,600
是为了什么
to wake us up?!

52
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,660
没人死了 是海莉被抓了
Nobody died. Haley's in jail.

53
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:40,940
好 这还说得通
Okay. That makes more sense.

54
00:01:41,180 --> 00:01:42,200
克莱尔要去保释她
Claire has to go bail her out.

55
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:43,480
好 电话给我
Okay. Give me that.

56
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,640
克莱尔 你听我说
Claire, listen to me--

57
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:47,080
带上大量的现金
Take a lot of cash.

58
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:49,020
然后在警察面前亮出绿油油的票子
And when you flash it to the police,

59
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:51,840
千万别张口提钱的事
Do not speak about it.

60
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:54,040
用眼神来交流 懂了吗
Let the eyes do all the talking, okay?

61
00:01:55,060 --> 00:01:56,700
我听到有电话来 谁死了
I heard the phone. Who died?

62
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:58,080
杰的朋友
Jay's friend.

63
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,300
杰 太令人遗憾了
Oh, Jay, I'm so sorry.

64
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,320
够了 我听不下去了
Okay. I can't do this again.

65
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:15,100
早饭热腾腾
It's breakfast

66
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,720
早餐时间到
It's breakfast time

67
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:18,720
早早吃饭身体好
It's breaky breaky time

68
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:20,300
小卡舅夫 我就觉得听到你声音了
Uncle Cam. I thought I heard your voice.

69
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:21,620
你在我家干什么 我爸妈呢
What are you doing here? Where are my parents?

70
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:24,620
大学打了电话来 说你姐姐得了大奖
Well, the school called, and your sister won a big award.

71
00:02:24,620 --> 00:02:25,840
编得不错 可这种谎言
Nice try. The only person

72
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:26,860
也只能骗骗海莉自己了
who would believe that Would be Haley.

73
00:02:27,580 --> 00:02:28,780
她进监狱了
She's in jail.

74
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:29,680
监狱
Jail?

75
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:30,840
莉莉 我说过什么来着
Lily, what did I say?

76
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,590
说她进监狱是迟早的事
That it was only a matter of time.

77
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:33,640
不 我可没这么说
Okay, no. Didn't say that.

78
00:02:33,860 --> 00:02:34,780
好吧 事情的真相是
Okay, so here's the truth.

79
00:02:34,860 --> 00:02:36,220
你姐姐因为喝酒被抓了
Your sister was caught drinking.

80
00:02:36,260 --> 00:02:37,640
但没什么大不了的
But it's no big deal.

81
00:02:37,660 --> 00:02:39,660
你父母已经赶去了 正在处理这事
Your parents are there taking care of it right now.

82
00:02:39,660 --> 00:02:40,380
所以
So...

83
00:02:40,380 --> 00:02:41,580
太棒了
This is so awesome!

84
00:02:41,580 --> 00:02:42,720
我希望她会在牢里开始健身
I hope she hits the weights

85
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,720
这样她出来时就化身肌肉女了
so she's totally ripped when she gets out.

86
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,760
好了 我们换个话题
Okay. Let's change the subject.

87
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,160
坐下来 吃点早餐
Have a seat. Have some breakfast.

88
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,340
看看盘子里有什么是你们最爱吃的
See if there's anything on that plate you like a lot.

89
00:02:52,580 --> 00:02:53,680
这是培根吗
Is this bacon?

90
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,960
当然是了 小笨蛋
Of course it is, silly.

91
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,080
鄙人最近有点小沉迷于健康养生
Been on a little bit of a health kick lately,

92
00:02:57,940 --> 00:02:59,900
所以我去上了素食烹饪课
so I took a vegan cooking class,

93
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:02,880
现在我最爱做的就是"素根"了
and my new thing is "Fakon."

94
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,080
跟真正的培根没有区别
It's like real bacon.

95
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:06,080
除了外观 口感和味道上的明显差异
Except for the look, the texture, and the taste.

96
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,020
超市里卖的可能如此
Maybe the store-bought kind.

97
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:08,620
但我的"素根"是自己做的 连"素根"都该算不上
But I make my own, so it's not even real fakon.

98
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:11,795
山寨素根 "山寨根"
It's faux-fakon. "Faux-kon."

99
00:03:12,409 --> 00:03:13,980
反正是"根"难吃
It's faux-kon disgusting.

100
00:03:13,980 --> 00:03:14,980
你根本就吃不出差别
You can't tell the difference.

101
00:03:14,980 --> 00:03:16,580
猜猜哪一盘是真培根
And guess which one's the real one?

102
00:03:16,580 --> 00:03:17,220
那一盘
That one.

103
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:18,680
那一盘
That one.

104
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,320
还是那一盘
Still that one.

105
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,400
这是我吃过最香的培根了
This is the best bacon I've ever had.

106
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,540
太好了
Oh, well.

107
00:03:26,540 --> 00:03:29,060
我恨不得马上告诉你米奇舅舅你喜欢这个
I can't wait to tell your uncle ,Mitchell that you love it.

108
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:30,228
为什么米奇舅舅在意这个
Why would uncle Mitch care?

109
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,220
亲爱的 因为
Because, my dear,

110
00:03:31,380 --> 00:03:33,860
你现在吃的培根根本不是培根哦
that bacon you're eating isn't bacon at all,

111
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:34,700
不是哦
No, no, no.

112
00:03:34,700 --> 00:03:35,860
完全由大豆制成
It's made entirely of soy.

113
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,700
卢克对大豆过敏
Luke's allergic to soy!

114
00:03:37,900 --> 00:03:39,540
他的喉咙会噎住 不能呼吸
His throat closes! He can't breathe!

115
00:03:39,620 --> 00:03:40,620
-你好 -没事了
- Hello? - Never mind!

116
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:41,344
好吧好吧
Okay, okay.

117
00:03:41,344 --> 00:03:43,616
我们得马上把你送到那个 医院去
We have to, uh, get you to the, uh, hospital!

118
00:03:43,627 --> 00:03:44,894
莉莉 来 宝贝
Lily! Come on, baby.

119
00:03:44,894 --> 00:03:46,680
卢克 快把假培根放下
Okay, Luke! Put the fakon down!

120
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,100
我在用它挠我的喉咙
I'm using it to scratch my throat!

121
00:03:48,100 --> 00:03:49,987
-好了好了 快走吧 快点 -走
- Okay. Okay. Let's go. Come on. - Go.

122
00:03:49,987 --> 00:03:52,260
小卡 小 小卡
Cam? C-cam?

123
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:53,040
真奇怪
That was weird.

124
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:55,540
克莱尔 你能不能开快点
Hey, Claire, do you wanna pick it up a little bit?

125
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:57,652
你从什么时候起按限速开车了
Since when do you drive at speed limit?

126
00:03:57,700 --> 00:03:59,480
我女儿因喝酒被捕了
My daughter has been arrested for drinking.

127
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:01,780
我希望她在监狱里痛定思痛
I would like her to sit in jail and think about that.

128
00:04:02,060 --> 00:04:02,940
其实 我想停车
As a matter of fact, I might stop

129
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:04,060
上直销店买点东西
and do a little outlet shopping.

130
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:07,080
谁想要买一副去年款式的太阳镜
Who wants a pair of last year's sunglasses, huh?

131
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:08,280
亲爱的
Honey...

132
00:04:08,980 --> 00:04:09,840
放松点
Try to relax.

133
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:11,360
我放松不下来 菲尔
I don't feel like relaxing, Phil!

134
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:13,360
她进大学才六个礼拜
She has been in college for six weeks.

135
00:04:13,420 --> 00:04:15,680
没错 每个人刚去的时候都会有点疯狂
Yeah, and everyone goes a little crazy at first.

136
00:04:15,700 --> 00:04:17,280
我记得大学头一年的一个晚上
I remember one night freshman year,

137
00:04:17,280 --> 00:04:18,800
我们飞盘高尔夫球队的一些人
a bunch of us on the frisbee golf team

138
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:21,460
拿一箱芝马酒 不必多说
got a case of zima. Enough zaid.

139
00:04:21,460 --> 00:04:22,940
说得够多了
More than enough.

140
00:04:23,186 --> 00:04:25,342
说实话
I'm not gonna lie.

141
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:28,240
菲尔面对压力还那么淡定有时候让我很恼火
Sometimes it bothers me how calm Phil is under pressure.

142
00:04:28,340 --> 00:04:29,020
感觉像是
It's like...

143
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:31,392
像是我反应过激了一样
like I'm the one who's overreacting.

144
00:04:31,392 --> 00:04:33,020
很好 宣泄出来 这样
That's good. Let it out. It's g--

145
00:04:33,020 --> 00:04:34,740
我要杀了你
I'm going to kill you.

146
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:38,360
杰 你今天有时间吗
Jay, do you have some time today?

147
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:39,800
我们得去选一辆婴儿车
We need to go and pick out a stroller.

148
00:04:39,980 --> 00:04:41,020
你想买什么样的就买去吧
Just get whatever you want.

149
00:04:41,030 --> 00:04:42,520
反正你也从来不会听我的意见
I mean, it's what you're gonna do anyway.

150
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,640
我想要的是一位
What I want is a husband

151
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,520
喜欢陪我逛街买婴儿车的丈夫
who likes to go shopping for a stroller with me.

152
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:47,320
如果你丈夫有挑选婴儿车的爱好
If you had a husband who liked picking out strollers,

153
00:04:47,340 --> 00:04:48,240
你就不会怀上孩子了
you wouldn't be having a baby.

154
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:51,180
谁要陪我去
So who wants to come with me

155
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:52,740
今晚的演讲节
to the Spoken Word Festival this evening?

156
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:53,920
我只有两张票
I only have two tickets,

157
00:04:53,930 --> 00:04:55,504
有人可能要失望了哦
so somebody's gonna be disappointed.

158
00:04:55,504 --> 00:04:56,418
我想是你要失望了
I think it's gonna be you.

159
00:04:56,418 --> 00:04:58,500
曼尼 我想跟你一起去 可是我好累啊
Ay, Manny, I would go with you, but I'm so tired.

160
00:04:58,500 --> 00:04:59,840
你才刚刚起床 怎么会累
You just woke up. How are you tired?

161
00:04:59,940 --> 00:05:02,160
因为我正在把食物加工成人
Maybe because I'm turning food into a human!

162
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:03,940
杰会带你去
Jay will take you.

163
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:07,620
抱歉 我也很想去
Sorry, I would love to go to the spoken word festival,

164
00:05:07,620 --> 00:05:08,803
但我得去
but I'm already going to the

165
00:05:08,803 --> 00:05:10,650
"不如炸掉我脑袋"狂欢节
I'd-rather- blow-my-brains-out jamboree.

166
00:05:10,660 --> 00:05:11,620
难以置信
I can't believe this.

167
00:05:11,660 --> 00:05:13,160
我居然生活在一片文化荒原
I'm living in a cultural wasteland.

168
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:14,140
配备温水泳池
With a heated pool.

169
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:16,886
曼尼 快点 上学快迟到了
Manny, vamos. You're gonna be late for school.

170
00:05:21,940 --> 00:05:22,980
老天
Oh, jeez.

171
00:05:24,737 --> 00:05:25,986
你好啊 迪迪
Hello, DeDe.

172
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,680
早上好 杰 合十致敬
Good morning, Jay. Namaste.

173
00:05:28,260 --> 00:05:29,200
别这样
Let's not do this.

174
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:30,880
好吧 小傻瓜
Oh, fine, silly.

175
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:33,900
我在去奥哈伊的一家静修所的路上
I'm on my way to a retreat in Ojai,

176
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,740
既然我将路过市中心
and since I'm passing through town,

177
00:05:35,740 --> 00:05:37,800
我想顺便拿那本相册
I thought I'd pick up that photo album.

178
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:39,480
现在可真不是时候
You know, it's really not a good time.

179
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,440
拜托
Oh, please.

180
00:05:41,580 --> 00:05:43,400
好吧 我到街上等你
All right. I'll meet you on the street.

181
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:45,160
车窗打开 开慢点
Drive by slow with the window open.

182
00:05:45,744 --> 00:05:48,829
我正担心迪迪发现歌洛莉亚怀孕了
I was dreading DeDe finding out that Gloria's pregnant.

183
00:05:48,829 --> 00:05:51,120
迪迪很在乎的一件事就是
It's one thing DeDe's hung on to,

184
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,440
她是我孩子的母亲
that she's the mother of my kids.

185
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:54,620
考虑到她们以往的恩怨
And considering their history...

186
00:05:57,034 --> 00:05:58,231
我想
I-I wanna...

187
00:05:58,231 --> 00:05:59,880
-扭断你的脖子 -什么
- rip your head off! - What?

188
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:02,123
别这样 快停下
No! Please stop it! Whoa!

189
00:06:02,123 --> 00:06:04,336
别 迪迪
Eh? No! DeDe!

190
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:09,740
我不希望还有第四轮较量
I wasn't exactly looking forward to round four,

191
00:06:10,020 --> 00:06:13,300
特别是歌洛莉亚现在体积庞大 行动迟缓
especially now that Gloria's a bigger, slower target.

192
00:06:14,300 --> 00:06:16,460
往常这时候我在吃早饭呢
I'd normally be having breakfast right now.

193
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,500
老爸好
Hi, dad.

194
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:22,000
克莱尔 有什么新进展吗
Hey, Claire. Any updates?

195
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:23,460
没有 不过我们快到了
Not yet, but we're almost there.

196
00:06:23,660 --> 00:06:24,900
上次你来家里
Last time you were over at the house,

197
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:26,100
看了一本相册
you were looking at that photo album.

198
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:26,980
你把它放哪儿了
What'd you do with it?

199
00:06:27,260 --> 00:06:28,700
老爸 那是我
Oh, dad, that was me.

200
00:06:28,820 --> 00:06:30,560
我大概是把它放在吧台后面的架子上了
I think I put it on the shelf behind the bar.

201
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,760
你在那做什么
What are you doing there?

202
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,180
他们让我陪他们过来
They asked me to come along

203
00:06:33,180 --> 00:06:34,340
以防他们需要位律师
in case they needed a lawyer.

204
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,700
他们不该请一位真律师吗
Shouldn't they have a real lawyer?

205
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,080
天呐 我们该不该呢
Oh, God. Should we?

206
00:06:37,140 --> 00:06:38,880
我就是位真律师 各位
I am a real lawyer, people.

207
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,440
环境法也是法啊
Environmental law is a thing.

208
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,060
别对我的话那么挑刺
Don't get all sensitive on me.

209
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:43,620
我的意思是 别找个替大熊猫辩护的律师
I mean someone who doesn't defend pandas.

210
00:06:43,620 --> 00:06:45,137
没错 老爸 那正是我的工作
Yeah, dad, 'cause that's what I do.

211
00:06:45,148 --> 00:06:47,080
我在法庭上替大熊猫的权益辩护
I-I defend pandas in court.

212
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:47,860
真可爱
That's adorable.

213
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:49,180
你知道我是什么意思
You know what I'm talking about.

214
00:06:49,180 --> 00:06:50,760
海莉需要懂刑法的人
Haley needs somebody who knows criminal law,

215
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,600
比如佩瑞·梅森 [美侦探小说虚构人物]
like Perry Mason.

216
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:54,680
所以我不是真正的律师 佩瑞·梅森倒是了
Okay, so I'm not a real lawyer, but Perry Mason is?

217
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:55,980
见鬼
Oh, hell.

218
00:06:58,820 --> 00:07:00,900
你好 迪迪 你怎么样啊
Hello, DeDe. How're you doing?

219
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:02,240
还不错
Oh, mostly fine.

220
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:05,880
我安了一种叫做伸缩式子宫的东西
I have something called a telescoping uterus.

221
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:09,043
-说来话长 -上帝
- Long story. - Aw, jeez.

222
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:10,360
给我让开
Out of my way!

223
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:12,420
-让开 -我喘不上来气了
- Out of my way! - I can't breathe!

224
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,420
这孩子喘不上来气了
This boy can't breathe.

225
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,160
他有过敏反应
He's having a severe allergic reaction.

226
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,700
不是 是你压的
No. You're squeezing me.

227
00:07:16,820 --> 00:07:18,620
他得吃药 他嗓子要堵上了
He needs medicine. His throat is closing up.

228
00:07:18,740 --> 00:07:19,420
好 等等
Okay. Hold on.

229
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,000
有一名过敏反应病人
We have an allergic reaction.

230
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:23,680
是个小男孩 呼吸不畅
A young boy. Obstructed breathing.

231
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,160
怎么了
What happened?

232
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,240
有人给他吃了大豆做的培根
Well, somebody gave him some soy bacon...

233
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,620
做得太好了 他没看出来差别
That was so good, he couldn't tell the difference.

234
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,660
米奇尔 我现在说话不方便
Mitchell, I can't talk right now.

235
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,220
小卡 是克莱尔 我电话关机了
Cam, it's Claire. My phone died.

236
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:35,000
我就是想确认下孩子们已经顺利到学校了
I just wanted to make sure the kids got to school okay.

237
00:07:35,020 --> 00:07:36,380
是的 他们当然去了 怎么会没有
Oh, yeah, of course they did. Why wouldn't they have?

238
00:07:36,380 --> 00:07:38,480
-我听说有位男孩不能呼吸 -在这里
- I hear we got a boy who can't breathe? - Right here.

239
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,100
什么情况
What was that?

240
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:41,320
我正看一部生活台原创电影
Oh, I'm just watching an original Lifetime movie

241
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:42,080
叫做《不能呼吸的男孩》
called "The boy who can't breathe."

242
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,100
听着像艾丽克斯的声音
That sounded like Alex.

243
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:45,520
不是 是阿曼达·拜恩斯 我得挂了
Nope. Just Amanda Bynes. Okay, gotta go.

244
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:48,700
小卡 小卡
Cam. Cam?

245
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:50,600
奇了怪了
That's weird.

246
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:53,302
你能想象我们路过了多少家华夫饼店吗
Can you believe how many waffle places we passed?

247
00:07:53,302 --> 00:07:55,100
我无法想象老爸有多么轻视我
I can't believe how much dad belittles me.

248
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:56,180
有多少来着 五家 六家
What were there? Five? Six?

249
00:07:56,740 --> 00:07:57,820
我做过法律评论编辑
I edited the law review.

250
00:07:57,860 --> 00:07:59,400
司法考试一次就过了
I passed the bar on my first try.

251
00:07:59,420 --> 00:08:00,480
我还拎着公文包
I have a briefcase.

252
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,720
回去的路上我得数数
I'm counting them on the way back.

253
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:03,115
注意力集中
Can we focus?

254
00:08:03,115 --> 00:08:04,750
你好 我们是为海莉·邓菲来的
Uh, hi. We're here for Haley Dunphy.

255
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:06,860
我是米奇尔·普里契特 邓菲小姐的律师
I'm Mitchell Pritchett. I'm Miss Dunphy's attorney.

256
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,520
她今天不需要律师
She won't be needing a lawyer today.

257
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:10,420
我觉得这该由我说了算
Oh, I think I'll be the judge of that.

258
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:12,280
我现在要和我的当事人谈谈 谢谢
I'd like to confer with my client now. Thank you.

259
00:08:12,380 --> 00:08:14,420
你们只需要交上保释金就可以把她带走了
All you have to do is post bail, and she's all yours.

260
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:17,940
真的吗 那 那太好了
Really? Oh. That--that's fantastic.

261
00:08:17,940 --> 00:08:20,100
长官 我今天真没想
Sir, I am in no mood

262
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:21,540
-袒护我的女儿 相信我 -好了
- to defend my daughter today, believe me. - Okay.

263
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:23,640
不过 你觉得因为校园里的孩子喝点儿酒
But do you think it is the best use of resources

264
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:25,460
就把他们押起来不是滥用公共资源吗
to lock up college kids who've had a few drinks?

265
00:08:25,460 --> 00:08:28,080
女士 你的女儿被控拒捕
Ma'am, your daughter was charged with resisting arrest

266
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:29,520
并且袭警
and assaulting a police officer.

267
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:30,260
什么
What?

268
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:34,160
或许你该找个真正的律师
You probably should have called a real lawyer,

269
00:08:34,366 --> 00:08:36,006
因为我吧 那个...
'Cause I don't... I'm not...

270
00:08:40,868 --> 00:08:42,920
恐怕是有什么误会吧
Look, this has gotta be some kind of mistake.

271
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:43,720
我家女儿那么瘦小
Our daughter's tiny.

272
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:45,320
她怎么可能袭击别人呢
There's no way she assaulted anyone.

273
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,660
侮辱人还有点可能
Insulted, maybe.

274
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:49,220
那警察当时穿的是不是白袜子配黑皮鞋
Was--was the cop wearing white socks and dark shoes?

275
00:08:49,220 --> 00:08:50,540
那种搭配会让她抓狂
'Cause that really sets her off.

276
00:08:50,540 --> 00:08:51,520
或许你该看看这个
Maybe you should watch this.

277
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:52,960
停下
Stop!

278
00:08:52,970 --> 00:08:54,946
把手放在我能看见的地方
Put your hands where I can see 'em!

279
00:08:55,892 --> 00:08:58,536
这组镜头非常模糊
Okay. Now that's very blurry footage.

280
00:08:58,536 --> 00:09:00,748
我们怎么确定那就是海莉
How can we be sure that that's Haley?

281
00:09:01,633 --> 00:09:02,600
别动
Don't you move.

282
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:04,320
别伤害我 我只是一名学生
Don't hurt me! I'm just a student!

283
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,110
我叫海莉·邓菲
I'm Haley Dunphy!

284
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:09,940
真热啊
So hot.

285
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,040
这里真热
Hot in here.

286
00:09:15,540 --> 00:09:16,940
还要多久
How long is this gonna take?

287
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:19,700
我应该上学去的 我已经错过了生物课了
I should be in school. I'm missing biology right now.

288
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,520
你可是在医院啊 只要走到走廊上
You're in a hospital. Just step out into the hallway.

289
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:23,440
听听医生护士们聊天
Listen to the nurses and doctors talk.

290
00:09:23,780 --> 00:09:25,660
学到的科学知识和人性
You'll learn more about science and humanity here

291
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:27,500
比在课堂里待一学期学的都多
than you would in a classroom in an entire semester.

292
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:28,840
注意
Attention!

293
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:31,360
如果冰箱里有瓶写着"特丽莎"的酸奶
If there's a yogurt in the fridge that says "Theresa,"

294
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:34,000
那么只有特丽莎才能喝
then only Theresa gets to eat it!

295
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,300
生活如戏 好好学着
Drama. Soak it in.

296
00:09:36,695 --> 00:09:38,105
-老天爷啊 -卢克
- Oh, good god. - Okay, Luke,

297
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,720
那衣服开口应该在背面
the opening is supposed to be in the back.

298
00:09:39,900 --> 00:09:41,500
没门儿 我才不想别人看到我的屁股
No way. I don't want people to see my butt.

299
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:43,140
我还得打一针吗
Do I have to get another shot?

300
00:09:43,420 --> 00:09:44,780
你又要哭了吗
Are you going to cry again?

301
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,280
-她有必要在这里吗 -得了 你知道吗
- Should she be here? - Okay. You know what?

302
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,500
不需要再打针了
Nobody's getting any more shots.

303
00:09:47,580 --> 00:09:49,240
我们只要在这里等着消肿就行了
We just have to wait for the swelling to go down.

304
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,720
好吗 我得去看看一些文件
All right? I'm gonna go check on a little paperwork.

305
00:09:50,730 --> 00:09:52,482
马上就回来
I'll be right back.

306
00:09:54,143 --> 00:09:56,240
不过 如果不消肿的话
But if it doesn't go down,

307
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:58,100
就得卸掉你的腿
that leg might have to come off.

308
00:09:58,380 --> 00:09:59,800
太好了 两条腿都卸了吧
Sweet. Take them both.

309
00:09:59,811 --> 00:10:01,440
那我就能装上那种刀锋腿
Then I could get some of those blade legs

310
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,620
终于可以灌篮了
and finally be able to dunk.

311
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,860
感觉怎样 小子
How you feeling, champ?

312
00:10:04,020 --> 00:10:04,920
我来看看是什么情况
What do we got here?

313
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:07,260
病人支气管发炎
The patient presents bronchial inflammation,

314
00:10:07,460 --> 00:10:09,700
皮肤瘙痒 伴有轻度神经性水肿
Dermal pruritus, and minor angioedema.

315
00:10:09,780 --> 00:10:10,700
谁能说出病因
Who can tell me the cause?

316
00:10:14,180 --> 00:10:16,180
是大豆引起的过敏反应
It's an allergic reaction to soy.

317
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:18,180
很好
Very good.

318
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,380
其他人学着点 去下一病房
The rest of you have a lot to learn. Let's keep moving.

319
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,140
你守着卢克
Stay with Luke.

320
00:10:26,900 --> 00:10:29,080
怎么这么久
What is taking so long?

321
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:31,748
以我的经验 这种事可能要等很久
Well, in my experience, these things can take time.

322
00:10:31,748 --> 00:10:35,440
所以 坐好吧 估计要等上一阵了
So... settle in. This--this could be a while.

323
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,120
她出来了
There she is.

324
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:36,900
该死
Damn it.

325
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:38,622
谢天谢地
Oh, thank god.

326
00:10:38,622 --> 00:10:40,790
-你还好吗 -我没事 妈妈
- You're okay? - Yeah, I'm fine, mom.

327
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:42,160
你当时脑子是进水了吗
Oh! What the hell were you thinking?

328
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:43,000
怎么回事
What happened?

329
00:10:43,340 --> 00:10:44,580
没什么大不了的 好吗
It's not a big deal, okay?

330
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:46,320
我们在开派对 大家喝得正酣
There was a party, and people were drinking...

331
00:10:46,380 --> 00:10:47,720
警察就过来了
so the police showed up,

332
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,780
所有人都往外跑 我也跟着跑
and everybody ran, so I did, too.

333
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:51,900
我顺着消防梯往下爬
And I started climbing down this fire escape...

334
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:54,260
然后我听到一个警察喊 把手举起来
And then I heard a cop yell to put your hands up,

335
00:10:54,260 --> 00:10:57,020
我照做了 于是就掉...在他身上了
so I did and I fell... onto him.

336
00:10:57,140 --> 00:10:58,380
你可能会没命的
You could have been killed.

337
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:00,380
海莉 你应该成熟一点了
Haley, you're supposed to be an adult.

338
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,920
怎么能做出这么幼稚的事来呢
How could you do something so childish...

339
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:03,172
-好了好了 -还这么愚蠢
- Okay, okay, okay, okay. - And so stupid?

340
00:11:03,180 --> 00:11:06,160
冷静一下 我们都有点累有点暴躁
Let's calm down. We're all a little tired and cranky.

341
00:11:06,180 --> 00:11:07,480
现在我们最好
Best thing we can do right now

342
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:09,480
出去买些华夫饼吃
is get out of here, go get some waffles--

343
00:11:09,580 --> 00:11:11,580
菲尔 我不想买什么华夫饼 好吗
I don't want waffles, Phil, okay?

344
00:11:11,580 --> 00:11:13,080
我很生气 我要处理这件事
I'm upset and I want to deal with this.

345
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,400
听着 我这里有个不好的消息
All right, I got some bad news here.

346
00:11:14,410 --> 00:11:15,850
今天下午
Um, this afternoon,

347
00:11:15,860 --> 00:11:17,980
海莉要接受纪律委员会的审讯
Haley has to appear before a disciplinary board,

348
00:11:18,180 --> 00:11:20,440
而他们会决定是否要开除她的学籍
which will decide whether or not she gets kicked out of school.

349
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:21,060
什么
What?

350
00:11:21,075 --> 00:11:23,465
慢着 等等 不对 我弄错了
Oh, wait. Wait, no. I got that wrong.

351
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,900
没有 我没弄错
Oh, no, I got it right!

352
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:28,320
好样的 了不起 加我一分
Yes! Score. One for me.

353
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:30,740
听起来虽然是那样
It's what it sounds like.

354
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:32,940
它真的会缩小
It literally telescopes.

355
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,320
是这样的
You see, what happens is...

356
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,300
迪迪 抱歉我不能和你聊了
DeDe, I hate to rush this,

357
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:36,320
我开会要迟到了
but I'm late for a meeting.

358
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:39,000
很高兴见到你 但我可以送你出去了吗
And it's been great seeing you, but can I walk you out?

359
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,200
好吧 当然
Okay. Sure.

360
00:11:42,399 --> 00:11:44,500
杰 好奇怪
Ay, Jay, it's so weird.

361
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:46,140
我刚一进门
The moment I came through the door,

362
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:47,900
宝宝就开始疯狂踢我
the baby started kicking like crazy,

363
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:50,540
好像想从我肚子里爬出来似的
like it's trying to claw its way out of me.

364
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:52,380
老巫婆
Bruja!

365
00:11:53,220 --> 00:11:54,560
天呐
Oh, my god.

366
00:11:54,620 --> 00:11:55,580
她怎么会在这里
What is she doing here?

367
00:11:55,620 --> 00:11:57,500
你们要有小宝宝了吗
You're going to have a baby?

368
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:59,200
难以置信
I don't believe it.

369
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:01,819
迪迪 别反应过度
Uh, DeDe, don't get all crazy about this.

370
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:04,360
这是怎么了
What's happening?

371
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:06,740
她脑子 坏掉了
Her brain. It snapped.

372
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:09,900
你这把年纪居然又喜当爹了
Oh! You're going to be a father again at your age.

373
00:12:09,900 --> 00:12:11,480
而你还满心以为你可以
And here you were thinking

374
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,780
与你年轻漂亮的娇妻
you would just sail off into the sunset

375
00:12:13,780 --> 00:12:16,280
安享晚年
with your beautiful young wife,

376
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:17,920
无忧无虑
not a care in the world.

377
00:12:17,980 --> 00:12:20,080
这太美妙了
This is fantastic!

378
00:12:20,260 --> 00:12:23,700
我觉得我的子宫就这么不治而愈了
I think my uterus just fixed itself.

379
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:25,080
什么也别问
Don't ask.

380
00:12:27,860 --> 00:12:31,060
不是吧 怎么会有人过成这样
Oh no. Who lives like this?

381
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:32,877
我住宿舍的时候 那可是
When I had a dorm room, it was...

382
00:12:32,877 --> 00:12:34,009
那是一尘不染的
oh--it was spotless.

383
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:35,900
大家同不同意女孩就是不如男孩爱干净
Can we just agree that girls are dirtier than boys?

384
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:37,473
-我们怎么办 -我觉得可以先从
- What should we do? - Well, I'd like to start

385
00:12:37,473 --> 00:12:38,829
收拾这堆衣服开始 然后
by picking up some of these clothes. Then--

386
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,940
我是说听证会怎么办 威猛先生
I meant about the hearing, Felix.

387
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,020
我们有应对策略吗
Do we have a game plan?

388
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:43,420
我认为最好的策略是
I think the best thing we can do is

389
00:12:43,420 --> 00:12:44,380
去表现出五好家庭的样子来
walk in there as a family

390
00:12:44,380 --> 00:12:46,240
告诉他们无论如何我们都支持海莉
and let them know we support Haley no matter what.

391
00:12:46,260 --> 00:12:48,220
照这样下去 我们下半辈子
At this rate, we are going to be supporting Haley

392
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:49,400
都得养着海莉了
for the rest of our lives.

393
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:50,554
好吧 我
Okay. Oh, I...

394
00:12:50,554 --> 00:12:52,515
我屁股下面有半个桃子 不行
I just sat on half a peach, so I--no.

395
00:12:52,515 --> 00:12:54,976
我忍不了了 我去外面等着
I can't do this. I'm--I'm waiting outside.

396
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:56,580
真恶心
Disgusting.

397
00:12:56,820 --> 00:12:57,740
你穿的这是什么啊
What are you wearing?

398
00:12:58,100 --> 00:12:58,920
怎么了 这有什么不妥的
What? What's wrong with it?

399
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:01,200
宝贝 你是要去跟纪律委员会
Honey, you are fighting for your future

400
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,320
为自己的未来作斗争
in front of a disciplinary committee,

401
00:13:02,420 --> 00:13:04,200
不是去给特务机关提供娱乐服务的
not entertaining the Secret Service.

402
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,400
《律政俏佳人》里面的艾尔能打赢官司
In "Legally Blonde," Elle won her case

403
00:13:06,400 --> 00:13:08,280
是因为她坚持自我 而且打扮俏丽
because she was true to herself and dressed cute.

404
00:13:08,380 --> 00:13:09,420
海莉 这是现实生活
Haley, this is real life,

405
00:13:09,420 --> 00:13:10,500
不是在演一部好电影
not an excellent movie.

406
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:12,420
宝贝 去找件别的衣服穿
Honey, just put on something else,

407
00:13:12,420 --> 00:13:13,320
再把妆化淡一点
and take down the makeup.

408
00:13:13,460 --> 00:13:15,960
你们干嘛表现得好像这都是我的错一样
Why are you guys acting like this is my fault?

409
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:18,220
每个人都喝酒了 也都逃跑了
Everybody was drinking, everybody ran.

410
00:13:18,220 --> 00:13:19,160
我只是被逮住了而已
I just got caught.

411
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,840
我甚至算得上是受害者
If anything, I'm the victim here.

412
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:24,980
什么 别 别说了 海莉
What?! Just stop-- just stop talking, Haley.

413
00:13:24,980 --> 00:13:27,400
你不是受害者 你犯了错
You're not the victim here. You're the one who screwed up!

414
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:29,480
你做了一个又一个错误的决定
You made one bad decision after another,

415
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,650
而现在你有可能会葬送你妈妈和我
and now you're about to blow everything

416
00:13:30,660 --> 00:13:32,540
辛辛苦苦为你打造的一切
your mother and I worked so hard to give you.

417
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:34,660
最让人寒心的是 你看起来根本不在乎
And the worst thing is, you don't seem to care.

418
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:36,740
我们凌晨三点就起床
We all got up at 3:00 a.m. this morning

419
00:13:36,740 --> 00:13:38,020
来保你出狱
to bail you out of jail!

420
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:39,580
一点东西都没吃
We haven't eaten a thing,

421
00:13:39,580 --> 00:13:40,960
而你有些话到现在都还没说
and you know what I haven't heard from you yet?

422
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:43,360
"对不起 妈妈 我错了 爸爸
"I'm sorry, mom. I screwed up, dad.

423
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,680
请原谅我"
Please forgive me."

424
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:46,360
现在去找件正经的衣服穿上
Now put on some real clothes.

425
00:13:46,540 --> 00:13:49,040
我们在听证会上见 不许迟到
We'll see you at the hearing. Do not be late!

426
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,020
走
Come on.

427
00:13:50,020 --> 00:13:51,400
你们去哪儿
Where are you going?

428
00:13:51,700 --> 00:13:53,340
去给那个男人买华夫饼
To get that man a waffle.

429
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:59,240
有了 有了 你感觉到它踢我了吗
There. There. Did you feel it kicking?

430
00:13:59,260 --> 00:14:01,600
感觉到了 记忆犹新啊
Oh, yes! Oh, I remember those.

431
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:05,160
克莱尔一长腿就开始踢我
Yeah, Claire kicked me as soon as she grew legs,

432
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:08,519
长到4岁才不踢了
and she didn't stop until she was 4.

433
00:14:08,933 --> 00:14:10,120
曼尼没这样
Not Manny.

434
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:11,440
他非常淡定
He was so calm,

435
00:14:11,640 --> 00:14:13,740
我觉得他是在我肚子里看书呢
I think that he was reading in there.

436
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,060
太美好了
This is beautiful.

437
00:14:15,100 --> 00:14:17,380
瞧你们两个 跟老朋友似的聊天
Look at you two, having a conversation like old friends.

438
00:14:17,380 --> 00:14:20,420
她不掐我的时候很好相处
Well, it's easier to talk to her when she's not choking me.

439
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,540
很抱歉
I'm sorry.

440
00:14:22,100 --> 00:14:24,020
那是我的人生低谷
I went through a bad patch there

441
00:14:24,020 --> 00:14:27,520
吃药吃的有点多
when I was trying to find the right balance with my Meds.

442
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:30,520
最近我发现我的猫弗朗西斯
I recently discovered my cat Frances

443
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:32,000
被埋在后院了
buried in the backyard.

444
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:34,780
我只祈祷它不是被我活埋的
I'm just praying that she died first.

445
00:14:34,780 --> 00:14:38,079
或许哪天你能来当那条吃鞋狗的看护
Maybe you can dogsit for the shoe-eater one day.

446
00:14:38,079 --> 00:14:42,120
那小东西长得真幽默
Oh, well, she is a... funny-looking thing.

447
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:43,560
别听她们的 你很漂亮
Don't listen to them. You're beautiful.

448
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,620
歌洛莉亚的大肚子倒是让迪迪
Turns out Gloria being pregnant

449
00:14:45,620 --> 00:14:49,820
对她的敌意大减 反而关爱有加
somehow made DeDe think of her as less trophy, more human.

450
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:52,980
她对歌洛莉亚的憎恨
And all the animosity she had for Gloria

451
00:14:53,900 --> 00:14:55,900
也全都烟消云散了
just wafted up in the air...

452
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:58,040
希望你雇了保姆
I hope you're hiring a nanny,

453
00:14:58,240 --> 00:15:01,160
因为这家伙手都懒得抬一下
because this one won't lift a finger.

454
00:15:02,260 --> 00:15:04,800
批评都落到我头上了
And landed right on top of me.

455
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:08,580
我记得他连一块尿布都没换过
I don't remember him changing a single diaper.

456
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:09,740
这话什么意思啊
What's that supposed to mean?

457
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:12,020
你连活埋了自己的猫都不记得
You can't even remember killing your cat.

458
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,800
我记得我没这么干
Oh, I don't think I did.

459
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:16,780
但是我很确定你从没换过尿布
But I'm sure that you never changed any diapers.

460
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:18,720
那只是因为你比我擅长换尿布嘛
It's just that you were better at it than I was.

461
00:15:18,940 --> 00:15:22,240
这么说半夜喂奶 清理呕吐物
Oh, so I guess I was better at late-night feedings

462
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:24,350
我也比你擅长咯
and cleaning spit-up, too.

463
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,260
说到这个
You know what?

464
00:15:25,260 --> 00:15:27,580
他也不愿意陪我挑手推车
He wouldn't help me pick up a stroller

465
00:15:27,580 --> 00:15:30,620
毯子和婴儿摇椅
or a blanket or a bouncy chair.

466
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:34,260
那些东西我也是自己去买的
Oh, well, I had to get that stuff on my own.

467
00:15:34,660 --> 00:15:35,940
他一点用都没有
He was just useless.

468
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:38,420
你太可怜了
You poor thing.

469
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:42,040
我算是知道你为啥变得这么疯了
Makes all sense now why you became so crazy.

470
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:42,740
是吧
Right?

471
00:15:42,816 --> 00:15:45,900
听好了 杰·普里契特
Listen to me, Jay Pritchett.

472
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:48,380
你要是不肯把自己变废为宝
If you don't change your useless ways,

473
00:15:48,500 --> 00:15:50,720
我也会发疯的
You're gonna make me crazy, too!

474
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,060
疯的像迪迪
Like DeDe!

475
00:15:52,060 --> 00:15:53,520
歌洛莉亚 歌洛莉亚
Gloria. Gloria.

476
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,280
我可喜欢你来拜访了
I just love our little visits.

477
00:15:59,860 --> 00:16:01,080
妈妈 我回来了
Mom, I'm home!

478
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,168
嗨 曼尼
Oh, hi, Manny.

479
00:16:02,168 --> 00:16:05,140
迪迪 你好吗
DeDe. How are you?

480
00:16:05,140 --> 00:16:05,600
很好
Good.

481
00:16:06,190 --> 00:16:09,300
迪迪 是我呀
DeDe. It's me.

482
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:10,180
你到底怎么样啊
How are you really?

483
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,880
我的生活好多了
I'm on a better path.

484
00:16:13,300 --> 00:16:13,880
生命是一次旅途
It's a journey.

485
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:16,200
谢谢你的关心 曼尼
Thank you for asking, Manny.

486
00:16:16,820 --> 00:16:18,940
还有谢谢你的来信
And thank you for your letters.

487
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:20,340
那是门没落的艺术
It's a lost art.

488
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:22,160
没有人愿意用纸笔写信了
No one puts pen to paper anymore.

489
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:24,300
海莉·邓菲
Haley Dunphy?

490
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:25,900
没错 是我
Yes, that's me.

491
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:27,080
我是负责招生的院长米勒
I'm Dean Miller with admissions.

492
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:28,700
-这位是威廉姆斯教授 -您好
- This is Professor Williams. - Hi.

493
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:30,480
这位是我们的学生代表
And this is our student representative,

494
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:32,169
-艾顿·费德曼 -见到你很高兴
- Aidan Feldman. - Nice to meet you.

495
00:16:32,180 --> 00:16:32,560
不是吧你
Seriously?

496
00:16:33,340 --> 00:16:35,000
经济学课上我就坐你旁边
We sit next to each other in econ.

497
00:16:35,340 --> 00:16:37,320
-哦 对呀 -少来
- Oh, right. - Don't.

498
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:39,100
对于你我都是一种侮辱
It insults both of us.

499
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:39,940
主要是对于我
Mostly me.

500
00:16:39,940 --> 00:16:41,161
继续进行吧 艾顿
Move it along, Aidan.

501
00:16:41,161 --> 00:16:44,520
这里是惩戒听证会 不是犹太交友网
This is a disciplinary hearing, not JDate.

502
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:46,420
你被控告公共场所酗酒
You are charged with public drunkenness,

503
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:49,060
拒捕 以及袭警
resisting arrest, and assaulting a police officer,

504
00:16:49,140 --> 00:16:52,840
显然都违反了我们学校的行为准则
all of which obviously violate our school's code of conduct.

505
00:16:53,060 --> 00:16:55,240
先生 容我代表我的委托人说两句
Sir, if I may speak on behalf of my client...

506
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:55,920
你是哪颗葱
Who are you?

507
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:56,840
在下米奇尔·普里契特
I'm Mitchell Pritchett,

508
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:58,000
邓菲小姐的律师
I'm Miss Dunphy's attorney.

509
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:00,220
我们要求学生为自己代言
We require students to speak for themselves.

510
00:17:00,340 --> 00:17:03,240
不允许雇用律师 你都不应该来这儿
There are no attorneys allowed. You shouldn't even be here.

511
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:05,140
那我坐这儿保持沉默 侧耳聆听
What if I just sat in this chair and I was really super quiet

512
00:17:05,140 --> 00:17:05,960
您意下如何
and I just listen?

513
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,040
准了
I'll allow it.

514
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,920
别闹了 艾顿
Knock it off, Aidan.

515
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:10,200
邓菲小姐 你有什么
Miss Dunphy, is there anything

516
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:11,400
要为自己辩护的吗
you would like to say in your defense?

517
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:13,940
事实上 我没什么可辩护的
Actually, I have no defense.

518
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:17,900
我是喝了酒 不到合法年龄
I was drinking. I am underage.

519
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:19,940
我逃避抓捕
I ran from the police.

520
00:17:19,940 --> 00:17:22,480
虽说是意外 可我的确对那名警官造成了伤害
And even though it was an accident, I injured an officer.

521
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:25,586
我非常极其的抱歉
I am very, very sorry.

522
00:17:25,660 --> 00:17:28,120
自从来到这里 我犯了很多错
I've made a lot of bad decisions since I've been here,

523
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:30,060
现在也该担起责任了
and it's time I take some responsibility.

524
00:17:30,940 --> 00:17:32,680
比如有时候我在食堂里
Like sometimes in the dining hall,

525
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:35,620
他们给沙拉称重的时候我把称往下按了
I slip my pinky under the scale when they weigh my salad.

526
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:39,300
并且 我逃掉的晨课比上的还多
Also, I've missed more morning classes than I've been to.

527
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:41,980
我不知道电话约会的规则
I don't know what the policy is on dating T.A.S,

528
00:17:41,980 --> 00:17:43,740
但我觉得我违反了
But I think I broke it.

529
00:17:43,740 --> 00:17:44,975
-两次 -天呐
- Twice. - Oh, man.

530
00:17:44,975 --> 00:17:47,300
要是绝对坦诚的话
Oh, and if we're gonna be completely honest,

531
00:17:47,300 --> 00:17:48,740
我的大学申请书
on my application to get in here,

532
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:51,277
-我说了谎其实我是... -反对
- I lied about the fact that I was-- - Uh, objection!

533
00:17:51,277 --> 00:17:53,277
-基于何种理由 -凭什么他就能说
- On what grounds? - Oh, he gets to say it?! He gets to--

534
00:17:53,277 --> 00:17:54,760
邓菲小姐 邓菲小姐
Miss Dunphy, Miss Dunphy,

535
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:57,980
我们很欣赏你的坦率
We appreciate your... candor.

536
00:17:58,540 --> 00:18:00,940
你还有什么要补充吗
Is there anything else you'd like to add?

537
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:02,680
加油 野猫
Go, wildcats?

538
00:18:03,700 --> 00:18:04,400
我的天
Oh, boy.

539
00:18:05,300 --> 00:18:06,900
野猫根本不是我们的吉祥物
That's not even our mascot.

540
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:10,060
这个是做什么的
What does this do?

541
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:13,640
不知道 不过多谢奥巴马 你买单
I don't know, but thanks Obama, you're paying for it.

542
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:15,980
你看起来好多了 感觉怎样
Hey. You're looking a lot better. How you feeling?

543
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:17,780
比那边的肾结石强多了
Better than kidney stones over there.

544
00:18:17,780 --> 00:18:19,500
知道吗 现在你好转了
Yeah, you know what? Now that you're doing better,

545
00:18:19,500 --> 00:18:21,500
我应该打电话给你妈 告诉她这件事
I think I should call your mom and tell her what happened.

546
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:24,240
我知道开头不是很顺利
You know, I know it was a bit of a rough ride in the beginning,

547
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:26,180
但重要的是 我处理好了
but the important thing is, is I handled it.

548
00:18:26,180 --> 00:18:29,260
-大家都平安 -她这是怎么了
- And everybody's okay. - What happened to her?

549
00:18:29,260 --> 00:18:32,120
-喂 -她在看剖腹产时晕过去了
- Hello? - She passed out watching a C-section.

550
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:32,560
小卡
Cam?

551
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:34,100
没事儿
Never mind!

552
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:41,240
你在找什么
What are you looking for?

553
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:44,940
没什么 我制造嗓音是因为我火大
Nothing! I am making a lot of noise because I'm angry!

554
00:18:44,951 --> 00:18:47,200
歌洛莉亚 我会和你一起照顾宝宝的
Gloria, I'm gonna help you with the baby.

555
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:48,940
我现在不像生曼尼时那么年轻
I am not young like with Manny.

556
00:18:49,020 --> 00:18:50,380
我已经很累了
I am tired already,

557
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:52,880
而且以后任务更艰巨
and it's gonna get harder from here!

558
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,440
我一个人没法搞定
I can't do this on my own,

559
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,920
我怀孕都是你的"杰做"
and you did this to me,

560
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:57,680
所以这次你要担起做父亲的责任
so you're going to be here this time!

561
00:18:58,160 --> 00:19:00,700
那时候 我们的日子很拮据
Back then, we were living paycheck to paycheck.

562
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:03,200
我没有照顾孩子是因为我总在工作
the reason I wasn't around is I was working all the time.

563
00:19:03,820 --> 00:19:06,340
相信我 不是只有迪迪一个人夜不能眠
Believe me,Dede wasn't the only one having sleepless nights.

564
00:19:06,660 --> 00:19:07,940
现在不同了
But now it's different.

565
00:19:08,380 --> 00:19:10,400
现在什么事我都可以帮你
Now I can help you with everything.

566
00:19:12,060 --> 00:19:12,500
真的吗
Really?

567
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:16,040
从现在开始
Let's start right now.

568
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:17,860
-我喜欢这个 -哪个
- I like that one. - Which one?

569
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:18,800
银色的婴儿车
That silver stroller.

570
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:20,880
不 我们买那个绿色的
No, we're going to get the green one.

571
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:21,680
好的 接下来呢
Great. What's next?

572
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:22,760
我挑个你不喜欢的婴儿床怎么样
How about I pick out the wrong crib?

573
00:19:24,180 --> 00:19:25,300
你还好吗 艾丽克斯
How you doing, Alex?

574
00:19:25,300 --> 00:19:26,980
我很好 就是受到了严重打击
I'm fine, except for the crushing blow

575
00:19:26,980 --> 00:19:28,320
知道自己永远不会做医生
of knowing I'll never be a doctor.

576
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:29,820
也不会生小孩
Or have a baby.

577
00:19:29,820 --> 00:19:31,840
不知道海莉怎么样了
I wonder what's going on with Haley.

578
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:32,640
不知道
I don't know.

579
00:19:32,660 --> 00:19:34,820
我今天一直不爽你妈怀疑我为人父的能力
I've been so petty about your mom judging my parenting,

580
00:19:34,820 --> 00:19:37,320
我根本没想过她今天都经历了些什么
I haven't even thought about what she's going through today.

581
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:39,100
我感觉好糟糕 算了 我应该打给她
I feel awful. You know what? I should call her.

582
00:19:39,180 --> 00:19:41,320
你说什么呢 我妈觉得你是个很棒的家长
What are you talking about? Mom thinks you're a great parent.

583
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:42,720
真的吗
She does?

584
00:19:42,940 --> 00:19:44,740
是啊 她只是觉得你烤的东西难吃
Yeah, she just thinks you can't bake.

585
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:45,660
喂
Hello?

586
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:46,840
没事儿
Never mind.

587
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:51,980
造人是最简单的
Making a child is the easy part.

588
00:19:52,600 --> 00:19:55,100
难的是后面接踵而来的事
The hard part is everything that comes after.

589
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:56,440
保护他们的安全
Keeping them safe...

590
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:58,460
你可以告诉你妈我的烤饼
Well, you can tell your mother that my scones

591
00:19:58,460 --> 00:20:00,120
外面脆得恰到好处
are appropriately crunchy on the outside

592
00:20:00,120 --> 00:20:02,106
里边绵密得让人爱不释口
while delightfully dense on the ins--

593
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:03,640
看见了 看见了
Saw that. Saw it.

594
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:05,820
为他们做出牺牲
Making sacrifices for them...

595
00:20:06,260 --> 00:20:06,760
儿子
Hey, kid.

596
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:10,560
今晚我送你去参加那个诗歌朗诵什么的
I'll take you to that poetry reading thing tonight.

597
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:13,480
迪迪和我正在说这事儿
Actually, Dede and I were just talking.

598
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,160
她非常喜欢口语诗
She's a huge fan of spoken word...

599
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:16,820
我非常乐意送他去
And I would love to escort him.

600
00:20:16,820 --> 00:20:18,100
-拜托了 -去吧
- Please. - Go.

601
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:22,900
支持他们 哪怕他们让你失望
And standing by them, even when they let you down.

602
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:24,140
真的对不起
I really am sorry.

603
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:25,720
好样的
We appreciate that.

604
00:20:25,840 --> 00:20:27,240
你今天肯承担责任是好事
It's good that you stepped up today.

605
00:20:27,540 --> 00:20:30,700
是啊 有时候一个新的开始也不错
Yeah. Sometimes it's healthy to get a fresh start.

606
00:20:33,164 --> 00:20:36,720
难以置信 我该怎么办
I can't believe this. What am I gonna do?

607
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:38,680
他们说了你可以明年再申请入学
Well, they said you could reapply next year.

608
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:40,562
与此同时 你要找份工作
In the meantime, you're gonna get a job

609
00:20:40,572 --> 00:20:42,280
上一些课
and you're gonna take some classes.

610
00:20:42,280 --> 00:20:45,020
我会努力认真对待的
Well, I'm gonna buckle down and get a lot more serious.

611
00:20:45,020 --> 00:20:46,603
-好样的 -对
- Good for you. - Yeah.

612
00:20:46,613 --> 00:20:47,654
我的钥匙呢
Where are my keys?

613
00:20:47,654 --> 00:20:49,800
在化妆台上
Oh, they're right there on the makeup table.

614
00:20:49,800 --> 00:20:50,500
亲爱的
Oh, honey...

615
00:20:50,500 --> 00:20:52,546
那是书桌
That's a desk.

616
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:59,600
我的天 你怎么回来了
Oh, my god. What are you doing here?

617
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:00,800
我被学校赶出来了
I got kicked out.

618
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:03,380
来吧 要笑尽管笑 有话尽管说
So go ahead, make your jokes. Get it out of your system.

619
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:05,500
不 那太糟糕了 真替你难过
No, that's horrible. I'm so sorry.

620
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:08,280
没事的 我肯定
It'll be fine. I'm sure of it.

621
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:09,160
谢谢
Thank you.

622
00:21:09,980 --> 00:21:12,120
瞧你把我的房间弄的
Ew, what did you do to my room?!

623
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:14,080
这不全是你的房间 也是我的
Well, it's not exactly your room. It's--it's mine.

624
00:21:14,080 --> 00:21:16,460
这个滚蛋 这个滚蛋 我讨厌那个
This goes. This goes. I hate that.

625
00:21:16,780 --> 00:21:18,260
-这个好丑 -海莉 别这样
- This is ugly. - Haley, stop!

626
00:21:18,260 --> 00:21:19,420
-妈 -妈
- Mom! - Mom!

627
00:21:19,420 --> 00:21:21,280
这是什么 太阳系吗
What is this? A solar system?

628
00:21:21,380 --> 00:21:22,260
那是分子
It's molecules.

629
00:21:22,620 --> 00:21:23,460
就是傻蛋球
They're nerdy balls.

630
00:21:23,460 --> 00:21:25,460
艾丽克斯 别跟她吵
Alex, don't fight with her.

631
00:21:25,460 --> 00:21:26,320
她可能有刀
She might have a shiv.

632
00:21:27,380 --> 00:21:27,780
我们没事吧
We cool?
